WEBVTT

00:19:58.662 --> 00:20:00.032
suddenly turned around and agreed to give

00:20:00.032 --> 00:20:02.625
80 percent of his fortune

00:20:02.625 --> 00:20:04.342
to your foundation.

00:20:04.342 --> 00:20:06.078
How on Earth did that happen?

00:20:06.078 --> 00:20:08.056
I guess there's a long version
and a short version of that.

00:20:08.056 --> 00:20:09.438
We've got time for the short version.

00:20:09.438 --> 00:20:13.193
BG: All right. Well, Warren was a close friend,

00:20:13.193 --> 00:20:17.850
and he was going to have his wife Suzie

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.405
give it all away.

00:20:19.405 --> 00:20:22.846
Tragically, she passed away before he did,

00:20:22.846 --> 00:20:26.444
and he's big on delegation, and

00:20:26.444 --> 00:20:28.602
— (Laughter) —

00:20:28.602 --> 00:20:30.013
he said —